  "body": "## Changes\n- Add agent-friendly subcommands and JSON output/errors, independent of TUI logic.\n- Bundle an Agent Skill via `mac-cleanup skill`.\n- Require explicit confirmation for noninteractive cleanup and item paths for risky targets.\n\n## CLI migration\n**Breaking experimental CLI change:**\n- `--select` becomes `select`; `--update` becomes `update`.\n- `--clean [--dry-run]` becomes `clean --selected [--dry-run]`.\n\nFor automation, use `--json` and add `--yes` only after approving a dry run. Execution rescans; a dry run is not a saved plan.\n\n## Changelog\n* 0060b6327e153a6de6539ce229bd79bd9fded203 Add agent-friendly cleanup commands (#118)\n\n\n\n"
